     "body": "<p>After \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-3847\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3847\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Migration Utils does not support the DISABLED digest type from FoxML schema\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-3847\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n was merged, the disabled digest was no longer throwing an exception and logged as a warning. This allows the validator to run without an exceptions.</p>",
